  "subsystem": {
    "name": "VehiclePhysics",
    "responsibility": "Coordinate-frame math and global solver-state lifecycle: computeInverse3x3CoordinateTransform transforms forces/vectors between coordinate frames (3x3 inverse matrix built from cofactors and matrix-vector products), and PhysicsStateZeroInit zero-initializes a large global physics/dynamics solver state region.",
